**x = ( frac{sqrt{1875}}{sqrt{3888}} div frac{sqrt{1200}}{sqrt{768}} ) times frac{sqrt{175}}{sqrt{1792}} **

**Formula used:**

sqrt{a times b} = sqrt{a} times sqrt{b}

**Calculations:**

x = ( frac{sqrt{625 times 3}}{sqrt{1296 times 3}} div frac{sqrt{400 times 3}}{sqrt{256 times 3}} ) times frac{sqrt{25 times 7}}{sqrt{256 times 7}} 

⇒ x = ( frac{25sqrt{3}}{36sqrt{3}} div frac{20sqrt{3}}{16sqrt{3}} ) times frac{5sqrt{7}}{16sqrt{7}} 

⇒ x = ( (25)/(36) times (16)/(20) ) times (5)/(16) 

⇒ x = (5)/(9) times (5)/(16) 

⇒ x = (25)/(144) 

⇒ sqrt{x} = sqrt{(25)/(144)}

⇒ sqrt{x} = (5)/(12)

**∴ The correct answer is option (3).**
